    "selection": "Scalar load and store programs check loaded register values, including readbacks after stores. The atomic-add program checks the returned old value and reads the updated sum. An older division keeps the stores pending so the next load can observe the most recent value before they retire. REQUIREMENT_TESTS.tsv identifies the observations for each requirement."
  },
